<title>USA: AMEX to list Dean Witter Discover LEAPS.</title>
<headline>AMEX to list Dean Witter Discover LEAPS.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Stock Exchange (AMEX) said it will list long-term equity anticipation securities (LEAPS) on Dean Witter Discover &amp; Co shares on March 5.</p>
<p>The LEAPS, which are long-term equity options, will have initial strike prices of 30, 40 and 50, with expirations in January 1998 and January 1999, the exchange said.</p>
<p>Kalb, Voorhis &amp; Co/Cranmer &amp; Cranmer Inc will be the specialist unit on the floor, AMEX added.</p>
<p>((Chicago Derivatives Desk 312-408-8750))</p>
